  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tokmok Water Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The EBRD and the COM are providing support to the City of Tokmok to rehabilitate water supply services and selected wastewater improvements in the City. Investments are expected to significantly improve access to clean water, reduce water losses, improve resilience to climate change and optimise operating costs for the Tokmok Water Company.</narrative>
  </description>
